accTitle: Order lifecycle
accDescr: A placed order is paid, shipped and delivered. It can be cancelled before payment and refunded after payment.
[*] --> Placed
Placed --> Paid: payment approved
Placed --> Cancelled: customer cancels
Paid --> Shipped: parcel handed to courier
Paid --> Refunded: refund issued
Shipped --> Delivered: courier confirms
Delivered --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
Refunded --> [*]

